/T (Maya considered it longer than he expected. "I think most people want to trust that someone competent is handling the thing they can't handle themselves. I think that trust is supposed to be earned, not assumed, and I think that's exactly the distinction Voss stopped caring about a long time before either of us met him." She squeezed his hand. "I don't know if they'd want to know. I know they deserve the chance to decide that for themselves, eventually, once there's a world left standing to ask.")
